{"4690240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cozy Country", "steam_appid": 4690240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a cozy little world of your own.<strong> </strong>Paint forests, place rivers, build a village, add animals, then step inside and explore the world you've created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your landscape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690240/extras/4f67ce74711b94e16e44bcfb462e7a25.avif?t=1788267504\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690240/extras_big/4f67ce74711b94e16e44bcfb462e7a25.avif?t=1788267504 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint trees, flowers, bushes and rocks, shape the land, and draw paths through the countryside. Use scatter brushes to paint entire forests in a single stroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step inside your creation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Explore mode at any time and walk through the world you've created. Explore from first-person or third-person view, wander through forests, follow rivers, visit your village, and discover the little details of your landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let the rivers flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place rivers that wind through your landscape, flowing downhill and spilling over cliffs as waterfalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a range of cozy buildings and adjust their size, shape and colors. Add fences, bridges, paths and other little details to make your village feel like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring it to life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add animals, change the time of day and weather, adjust the sunlight, and watch your landscape come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take photos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Country is one big photo mode. Find a view you love, adjust the lighting, frame your scene, and take a photo whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax and breathe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made Cozy Country as a peaceful place to slow down, where you can build something small, step inside, and just be in it for a while. I hope you enjoy creating a cozy world that feels like your own❤️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a cozy little world of your own.<strong> </strong>Paint forests, place rivers, build a village, add animals, then step inside and explore the world you've created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your landscape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690240/extras/4f67ce74711b94e16e44bcfb462e7a25.avif?t=1788267504\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690240/extras_big/4f67ce74711b94e16e44bcfb462e7a25.avif?t=1788267504 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint trees, flowers, bushes and rocks, shape the land, and draw paths through the countryside. Use scatter brushes to paint entire forests in a single stroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step inside your creation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Explore mode at any time and walk through the world you've created. Explore from first-person or third-person view, wander through forests, follow rivers, visit your village, and discover the little details of your landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let the rivers flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place rivers that wind through your landscape, flowing downhill and spilling over cliffs as waterfalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a range of cozy buildings and adjust their size, shape and colors. Add fences, bridges, paths and other little details to make your village feel like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring it to life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add animals, change the time of day and weather, adjust the sunlight, and watch your landscape come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take photos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Country is one big photo mode. Find a view you love, adjust the lighting, frame your scene, and take a photo whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax and breathe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made Cozy Country as a peaceful place to slow down, where you can build something small, step inside, and just be in it for a while. I hope you enjoy creating a cozy world that feels like your own❤️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Escape into Cozy Country, a peaceful fantasy landscape creator. Paint forests, place rivers, build a village, add animals, then step inside your world and explore everything you've created. ❤️", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690240